if 'The publication-preparation revision expands' not in b:
 b += '\nThe publication-preparation revision expands Chapter 55 from four to fourteen primary works and adds an internal claim-by-claim review packet. It also makes the scope of PARTY_2’s information-boundary verdict explicit, preserves the visible out-of-game asides in T1, and records the report/export round-number discrepancy without rewriting either source.\n'
